1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,963
The Smith-Morra gives up a pawn to open every line.

2
00:00:04,043 --> 00:00:08,006
Black accepts, but White develops with a clear target.

3
00:00:08,086 --> 00:00:12,049
The bishop points at the king before the queen joins.

4
00:00:12,129 --> 00:00:16,091
Black develops the knight and walks toward the trap.

5
00:00:16,171 --> 00:00:20,134
The queen and bishop coordinate on the dark squares.

6
00:00:20,214 --> 00:00:24,177
A knight jump forces the final capture.

7
00:00:24,257 --> 00:00:28,220
The queen lands on h two: checkmate is already locked in.
